a domain like acme.sa.\",\"invalid_expiry\":\"Choose an expiry date in the future.\",\"invalid_issuer\":\"Enter your identity provider's issuer URL.\",\"invalid_metadata\":\"That metadata file is too large.\",\"invalid_plan\":\"Choose a supported plan.\",\"invalid_request\":\"Check the request settings and try again.\",\"invalid_scopes\":\"Choose at least one API available on your plan for this key.\",\"invalid_value\":\"This value can only contain letters, digits, - _ and .\",\"key_limit\":\"Your plan's active-key limit has been reached. Revoke one to create another.\",\"last_owner\":\"An organization needs an owner. Make someone else an owner first.\",\"last_project\":\"Keep at least one project. Create another first.\",\"missing_parameter\":\"Fill in the required fields.\",\"not_verified\":\"The DNS TXT record was not found yet. DNS changes can take a few minutes; try again shortly.\",\"plan_required\":\"Single sign-on is part of the Enterprise plan.\",\"project_exists\":\"A project with that name already exists.\",\"project_limit\":\"Your project limit has been reached.\",\"project_not_found\":\"That project doesn't exist or is archived.\",\"public_domain\":\"Use your company's own domain, not a public email provider.\",\"sso_not_ready\":\"Verify the domain and connect your identity provider first.\",\"too_many_invites\":\"Reduce the number of people in this invitation batch.\",\"too_many_pending\":\"Too many invitations are waiting. Revoke some before sending more.\",\"wrong_account\":\"Sign in with the invited email address to accept this invitation.\",\"unauthorized\":\"Please sign in to continue.\",\"forbidden\":\"You don't have permission to perform this action.\",\"not_found\":\"The requested resource was not found.\",\"invalid_input\":\"Please check the information you entered.\",\"signup_closed\":\"New account registration is currently closed. Contact us to request access.\",\"rate_limited\":\"Too many requests. Please wait and try again.\",\"slug_taken\":\"Please choose a different organization name.\",\"billing_disabled\":\"Self-serve billing is not available yet. Contact us for help.\",\"org_suspended\":\"This organization is suspended. Contact us to restore access.\",\"limit_exceeded\":\"Your plan's limit has been reached.\",\"reauth_required\":\"Please sign in again to confirm this action.\",\"domain_changed\":\"The domain claim changed. Add it again and retry verification.\",\"self_join_not_ready\":\"Verify this domain first. Domains that require SSO use SSO to join instead.\",\"self_join_unavailable\":\"This workspace isn't available for self-join. Ask an owner to invite you.\",\"join_request_unavailable\":\"You can't request to join this workspace right now. Ask an owner for an invitation.\",\"join_request_changed\":\"This request is no longer available. Refresh the requests or send an invitation.\"}},\"docs\":{\"title\":\"Guides\",\"browse\":\"Browse guides\",\"reference\":\"API reference\",\"endpointPrompt\":\"Looking for a specific endpoint?\",\"endpointCount\":\"The reference documents all {count} operations.\",\"introduction\":\"Introduction\"},\"marketing\":{\"valuation\":{\"eyebrow\":\"For valuers, lenders and rent financiers\",\"h1\":\"Market evidence for every Saudi valuation\",\"sub\":\"Comparables, market position and a price band for the property you're assessing, from every live listing in the Kingdom, beside the rents and deals registered for its neighborhood.\",\"ctaPilot\":\"Request a pilot\",\"ctaSample\":\"Download a sample check (PDF)\",\"sampleJson\":\"or as JSON\",\"disclosure\":\"Asking prices and registered contracts, not an appraisal. The valuation stays yours.\",\"sar\":\"SAR {value}\",\"perSqm\":\"SAR {value}/m²\",\"perYear\":\"a year\",\"checkTitle\":\"One check, on a live Riyadh listing\",\"checkSub\":\"What the API returns today for listing {id}, refreshed every hour. Your checks run on the property you send us.\",\"subject\":\"{bedrooms}-bedroom apartment for rent in {neighborhood}, Riyadh · {area} m²\",\"askingLabel\":\"Asking rent\",\"bandTitle\":\"Nearby price band\",\"bandCaption\":\"{units} comparable units within {radius} km, seen in the last {days} days\",\"p25\":\"25th percentile\",\"median\":\"Median\",\"p75\":\"75th percentile\",\"medianInterval\":\"The median's 95% interval: SAR {range}\",\"below\":\"This ask is {percent}% below the nearby median.\",\"above\":\"This ask is {percent}% above the nearby median.\",\"near\":\"This ask is close to the nearby median.\",\"uncertain\":\"The evidence can't tell this ask apart from the median.\",\"positionTitle\":\"Market position\",\"positionNeighborhood\":\"Priced higher than {percent}% of {count} comparable rentals in {neighborhood}.\",\"positionCity\":\"Priced higher than {percent}% of {count} comparable rentals in {neighborhood}, and {cityPercent}% of {cityCount} across Riyadh.\",\"compsTitle\":\"Nearest comparables\",\"distance\":\"Distance\",\"area\":\"Area\",\"askingRent\":\"Asking rent\",\"daysListed\":\"Days listed\",\"meters\":\"{value} m\",\"sqm\":\"{value} m²\",\"compsNote\":\"Nearest first, one row per distinct unit. The API returned {count}, and a check includes them all.\",\"registeredTitle\":\"Registered rents (REGA)\",\"registered\":\"{contracts} apartment leases registered in {neighborhood} in {period} averaged SAR {mean} a year.\",\"registeredPerSqm\":\"{contracts} apartment leases registered in {neighborhood} in {period} averaged SAR {mean} a year (SAR {perSqm}/m²).\",\"registeredNote\":\"Registered rents include renewals as well as new leases, so they usually sit below what's asked today. A check shows both, labelled, and never blends them.\",\"registeredSource\":\"Source\",\"quarter\":\"Q{quarter} {year}\",\"unavailable\":\"The live example is being refreshed. Download the sample check, or request a pilot.\",\"includesTitle\":\"What a check includes\",\"includes\":{\"comparables\":{\"title\":\"Comparables\",\"body\":\"Similar active listings nearby, with distance, size, price and how long each has been listed.\"},\"position\":{\"title\":\"Market position\",\"body\":\"Where the price you're given sits in its neighborhood and city: percentile, median and spread, with the sample size.\"},\"band\":{\"title\":\"Price band\",\"body\":\"The 25th percentile, median and 75th percentile of nearby asks, and whether the median is stable enough to lean on.\"},\"registered\":{\"title\":\"Registered evidence\",\"body\":\"REGA registered rents and Ministry of Justice deals for the neighborhood, where they exist, from Saudi open data.\"}},\"evidenceTitle\":\"Evidence you can defend\",\"evidence\":{\"dedup\":{\"title\":\"One listing per property\",\"body\":\"{count} duplicate ads merged, so an apartment advertised on three sites is one comparable, not three.\"},\"listings\":{\"title\":\"Every live listing\",\"body\":\"{count} live listings from 20+ sources, refreshed twice a day.\"},\"outliers\":{\"title\":\"Outliers left out\",\"body\":\"Asking prices far outside their neighborhood's range are filtered before any figure is computed, and every figure states its sample size.\"},\"history\":{\"title\":\"History since March 2026\",\"body\":\"Listing and price history kept since March 2026 backs trends and days on market.\"}},\"methodologyLink\":\"Read the methodology\",\"workflowsTitle\":\"Where it fits\",\"workflows\":{\"valuers\":{\"who\":\"Valuers\",\"title\":\"Gather the market evidence for a report\",\"body\":\"Send the property and get its comparables, band and registered rents back, instead of searching portals by hand.\"},\"financiers\":{\"who\":\"Rent financiers\",\"title\":\"Check a requested rent before you approve it\",\"body\":\"If a rent sits well above its nearby band, you know to ask why before the money moves.\"},\"lenders\":{\"who\":\"Lenders\",\"title\":\"Get a second opinion on collateral\",\"body\":\"See where asking prices around a property sit, and how much evidence there is, before you rely on a figure.\"}},\"buyingTitle\":\"Buying from Kite\",\"buying\":{\"pilot\":{\"title\":\"A 30-day pilot\",\"body\":\"Up to 50 checks, returned within one business day. The first five are free, so you can judge the evidence before you pay.\"},\"price\":{\"title\":\"Priced per check\",\"body\":\"In SAR, agreed with each pilot partner. Saudi businesses account for VAT under the reverse charge.\"},\"reports\":{\"title\":\"Use in your reports\",\"body\":\"Pilot partners may include Kite comparables in valuation reports for their own clients, credited “Data by Kite”.\"},\"security\":{\"title\":\"Security\",\"body\":\"Keys hashed at rest, an audit log, and SSO and IP allowlists on Enterprise.\"}},\"securityLink\":\"Security at Kite\",\"faqTitle\":\"Questions\",\"faq\":{\"appraisal\":{\"q\":\"Is a check an appraisal?\",\"a\":\"No. It's market evidence: asking prices from live listings and registered contracts, each with the sample behind it. The valuation, and the judgement in it, stay yours.\"},\"listed\":{\"q\":\"Does my property need to be listed?\",\"a\":\"No. For the pilot, send its city, neighborhood or coordinates, type, bedrooms and area, and we run the check. The self-serve API's analytics start from a Kite listing today.\"},\"prices\":{\"q\":\"Asking prices or registered deals?\",\"a\":\"Both, kept apart. Asking prices show today's market. Registered rents and deals show what was agreed, published each quarter. Every figure says which it is.\"},\"sample\":{\"q\":\"What if there aren't enough comparables?\",\"a\":\"The band isn't published when too few distinct units were seen nearby, and the check says so rather than stretching the evidence.\"},\"cities\":{\"q\":\"Which cities are covered?\",\"a\":\"{count} cities, deepest in Riyadh, Jeddah and the Eastern Province.\"}},\"closingTitle\":\"Try it on your next 50 properties\",\"closingSub\":\"Tell us what you value and roughly how many a month, and we'll set up the pilot.\",\"talkToUs\":\"Talk to us\"},\"nav\":{\"products\":\"Products\",\"useCases\":\"Use cases\",\"docs\":\"Docs\",\"guides\":\"Guides\",\"pricing\":\"Pricing\",\"valuation\":\"Valuation checks\",\"coverage\":\"Data coverage\",\"changelog\":\"Changelog\",\"status\":\"Status\",\"menu\":\"Menu\",\"platform\":\"Platform\",\"brandLabel\":\"Kite platform\",\"dashboard\":\"Dashboard\",\"signIn\":\"Sign in\",\"getKey\":\"Get API key\",\"startFree\":\"Start free, upgrade per product\",\"compare\":\"Compare plans\"},\"products\":{\"listings\":{\"title\":\"Live listings\",\"blurb\":\"Every active rental and sale\",\"job\":\"Search every listing in the Kingdom\",\"body\":\"Every active rental and sale in Saudi Arabia, deduplicated across 20+ sites, with photos, full detail and price history. Power search, alerts or a CRM sync.\"},\"market\":{\"title\":\"Market statistics\",\"blurb\":\"Medians, supply and vacancy\",\"job\":\"Know any neighborhood's market\",\"body\":\"Median rents and prices, price ranges, supply and vacancy for any city or neighborhood. Built for reports and market pages.\"},\"analytics\":{\"title\":\"Valuation \u0026 investment\",\"blurb\":\"Comparables, yields and deals\",\"job\":\"Price any property against its market\",\"body\":\"Comparables, a listing's position against its market, rental yields, price trends and below-market deals. Price a property or find the best-value ones.\"},\"projects\":{\"title\":\"Off-plan projects\",\"blurb\":\"New developments and units\",\"job\":\"Track new developments as they launch\",\"body\":\"New developments with their units, price ranges and developers, for buyers and lenders tracking new supply.\"},\"ai\":{\"title\":\"AI \u0026 MCP\",\"blurb\":\"Connect an assistant to Kite\"}},\"footer\":{\"product\":\"Product\",\"company\":\"Company\",\"legal\":\"Legal\",\"contact\":\"Contact\",\"security\":\"Security\",\"terms\":\"Terms\",\"subprocessors\":\"Subprocessors\",\"description\":\"Saudi real estate data for developers.\"},\"landing\":{\"new\":\"New\",\"title\":\"Real estate data infrastructure for Saudi Arabia\",\"sub\":\"Live listings with their asking prices, market statistics, valuations and off-plan projects from 20+ Saudi sources, deduplicated into one documented API.\",\"docs\":\"Read the docs\",\"csv\":\"Sample CSV\",\"freeNoCard\":\"Free plan, no card\",\"freeLaunch\":\"Free plan at launch\",\"signupClosed\":\"Self-serve sign-up opens soon. Tell us what you're building and we'll set you up.\",\"aggregated\":\"Aggregated from \u003csources\u003e\u003c/sources\u003e\",\"sourceList\":\"{names}{remaining, plural, =0 {} other { and # more}}\",\"official\":\"Plus \u003cjustice\u003eMinistry of Justice registered deals\u003c/justice\u003e and \u003crega\u003eREGA registered rents\u003c/rega\u003e, from Saudi open data and free on every plan.\",\"requestTitle\":\"Your first request in a minute\",\"requestSub\":\"One API key, plain JSON over HTTPS, and the same shape on every endpoint.\",\"closingTitle\":\"Start building with Saudi real estate data\",\"closingSub\":\"Free to start, no card needed. Upgrade when you need more.\"},\"features\":{\"listings\":{\"title\":\"Every live listing\",\"body\":\"Rentals and sales from 20+ Saudi sources, deduplicated to one listing per property and quality-filtered: the same inventory as kite.sa.\"},\"sync\":{\"title\":\"Built to sync\",\"body\":\"Stable cursors and \u003ccode\u003eupdated_since\u003c/code\u003e keep your CRM or product in step, with price history for every listing.\"},\"fields\":{\"title\":\"Normalized fields\",\"body\":\"Yearly and as-posted prices, financing options, neighborhood ids, coordinates, amenities, images and a link to the original ad.\"},\"sdk\":{\"title\":\"Official SDKs\",\"body\":\"\u003cjs\u003enpm install @kite-sa/sdk\u003c/js\u003e or \u003cpython\u003epip install kite-sa\u003c/python\u003e: automatic pagination and retries that respect rate limits, with typed parameters and responses in TypeScript.\"}},\"stats\":{\"activity\":\"\u003chighlight\u003e{count}\u003c/highlight\u003e new listings in the last 24 hours\",\"directory\":\"Listed in Anthropic's Connectors Directory\",\"listings\":\"live listings, refreshed twice a day\",\"sources\":\"sources, deduplicated\",\"duplicates\":\"duplicate ads merged across 20+ sources\",\"cities\":\"cities\",\"neighborhoods\":\"cities, {count} neighborhoods\",\"uptime\":\"API uptime, {days, plural, one {last day} other {last # days}}\",\"twice\":\"2× daily\",\"refresh\":\"refresh\"},\"families\":{\"title\":\"One API for the Saudi market\",\"sub\":\"Start with live listings on the free plan. Market statistics, valuation and off-plan projects unlock as you upgrade.\",\"reference\":\"API reference\",\"planUp\":\"{plan} and up\",\"explore\":\"Explore the endpoints\"},\"useCases\":{\"title\":\"Built for Saudi real estate teams\",\"sub\":\"From a two-person proptech startup to a bank's valuation desk, the same data fits the job.\",\"proptech\":{\"who\":\"Proptech apps\",\"title\":\"Launch search and alerts on live inventory\",\"body\":\"Build listing search, saved-search alerts and neighborhood pages on every active listing, without scraping 20+ sites yourself.\"},\"lender\":{\"who\":\"Banks and lenders\",\"title\":\"Check a price before you lend\",\"body\":\"Compare an asking price with the median of its comparables in the same neighborhood, size and type.\"},\"investor\":{\"who\":\"Investors and funds\",\"title\":\"Screen neighborhoods by yield\",\"body\":\"Rank neighborhoods by rental yield, trends and supply, and catch listings priced below their market.\"},\"broker\":{\"who\":\"Brokerages\",\"title\":\"Keep your CRM in sync with the market\",\"body\":\"Pull new and changed listings every day with \u003ccode\u003eupdated_since\u003c/code\u003e, and price new mandates against live competition.\"}},\"ai\":{\"title\":\"Or ask Claude instead\",\"sub\":\"Kite's MCP server gives Claude and other AI assistants read-only tools over the same live listings, market statistics and projects. It's listed in Anthropic's Connectors Directory. You sign in with your Kite account, and calls count against your workspace's plan, Free included.\",\"otherApps\":\"Other AI apps\",\"code\":\"In Claude Code\",\"question\":\"What does a 3-bedroom apartment rent for in Riyadh?\",\"questionNeighborhood\":\"What does a 3-bedroom apartment rent for in {neighborhood}, Riyadh?\",\"used\":\"Claude used\",\"answer\":\"The median asking rent for a 3-bedroom apartment in {neighborhood} is \u003chighlight\u003eSAR {median}\u003c/highlight\u003e a year. The middle half of listings ask SAR {low} to {high}.\",\"sample\":\"Based on {count} live listings. These are asking prices, not signed leases.\",\"fallback\":\"Median asking rent, price range and supply, from live listings.\"},\"faq\":{\"title\":\"Questions\",\"source\":{\"q\":\"Where does the data come from?\",\"a\":\"From 20+ Saudi listing sites and portals. We merge duplicates into one listing per property, filter out junk, and keep a link to every original ad. It's the same inventory you see on kite.sa.\"},\"fresh\":{\"q\":\"How fresh is it?\",\"a\":\"Sources are scraped twice a day. Every listing has an \u003cupdated\u003eupdated_at\u003c/updated\u003e, so a sync can ask for only what changed since its last run with \u003csince\u003eupdated_since\u003c/since\u003e.\"},\"cities\":{\"q\":\"Which cities are covered?\",\"a\":\"{count} cities, from Riyadh, Jeddah and the Eastern Province to Taif, Abha and Hail. \u003ccode\u003eGET /cities\u003c/code\u003e lists them all with their neighborhoods.\"},\"prices\":{\"q\":\"How are prices reported?\",\"a\":\"Every price is normalized to SAR per year so listings compare directly, and the as-posted amount and frequency (monthly, daily…) come alongside it. These are asking prices — what owners and agents want, not what anyone paid.\"},\"official\":{\"q\":\"Why not use REGA or the Ministry of Justice open data?\",\"a\":\"Different question, different data. The registered-deal feeds are closed transactions, published after the fact and heavily weighted to land plots — good for what a plot sold for, no help at all for what is available now, at what asking price, with how many bedrooms and which photos. Kite is the live market: what is on sale or for rent today, deduplicated across the sites it is advertised on. Plenty of teams use both.\"},\"history\":{\"q\":\"How far back does the history go?\",\"a\":\"Listing and price history are kept from March 2026, which bounds \u003ccode\u003eprice-history\u003c/code\u003e and the trend endpoints. Current inventory goes back as far as each listing has been live.\"},\"units\":{\"q\":\"What's a unit?\",\"a\":\"Plans are metered in units, not requests: a page of 10 listings or a single market statistic costs 1 unit, valuation calls 10 to 15. Every response states its cost in the \u003ccode\u003eX-Request-Units\u003c/code\u003e header, and each endpoint's cost is in the \u003creference\u003eAPI reference\u003c/reference\u003e.\"},\"limit\":{\"q\":\"What happens when I reach my limit?\",\"a\":\"The free plan stops at 250 units a month. Paid plans keep working and bill extra usage per 1,000 units, up to a spend cap you set. Failed requests are never counted.\"},\"display\":{\"q\":\"Can I show the data in my product?\",\"a\":\"Yes: display it to your users with a “Data by Kite” credit. You can't resell it as a dataset. The details are in the \u003cterms\u003eAPI terms\u003c/terms\u003e.\"}},\"coverage\":{\"title\":\"Where the data comes from\",\"sub\":\"{listings} live listings from {sources} Saudi sources, merged into one listing per property and refreshed twice a day. Here is what's covered, how it's cleaned, and what each number means.\",\"download\":\"Download a sample (100 listings, CSV)\",\"listings\":\"live listings\",\"sources\":\"sources\",\"cities\":\"cities\",\"duplicates\":\"duplicate ads merged\",\"new\":\"new in the last 7 days\",\"sourcesTitle\":\"Sources\",\"sourcesSub\":\"Live listings each source contributes, after merging.\",\"source\":\"Source\",\"rent\":\"Rent\",\"sale\":\"Sale\",\"citiesTitle\":\"Cities\",\"citiesSub\":\"Live listings and neighborhoods covered.\",\"city\":\"City\",\"neighborhoods\":\"Neighborhoods\",\"methodology\":\"Methodology\",\"methodologySub\":\"What the API does to the data before you see it.\",\"asOf\":\"Figures as of {date} (Riyadh time), refreshed hourly. Listings are third-party advertisements; see the \u003cterms\u003eAPI terms\u003c/terms\u003e for how you may use them.\",\"collection\":{\"title\":\"Collection\",\"body\":\"Kite reads public listings from each source twice a day. A listing stays live while its source still shows it; \u003cseen\u003elast_seen_at\u003c/seen\u003e says when Kite last confirmed that, and \u003cupdated\u003eupdated_at\u003c/updated\u003e is the source's own update time where it publishes one.\"},\"dedup\":{\"title\":\"One listing per property\",\"body\":\"Agents often post the same property on several sites, or several times on one. Kite groups those ads by photo similarity (perceptual hashes) together with location, price, size and bedrooms, keeps one primary listing, and lists the other sources in \u003ccode\u003ealso_listed_on\u003c/code\u003e. Search, counts and market statistics only count the primary.\"},\"quality\":{\"title\":\"Quality filtering\",\"body\":\"Search, counts and market statistics leave out implausible listings. Price fences are set per tier from the median and MAD of log price — robust against the mislabelled listings that would drag a percentile around — alongside bedroom and area sanity checks and a floor at 30% of the neighborhood median. Detail and batch lookups skip that filter, so they return listings search won't.\"},\"prices\":{\"title\":\"Prices\",\"body\":\"\u003cyearly\u003eprice.yearly_sar\u003c/yearly\u003e is the number to compare: rents posted monthly, weekly or daily are converted to a yearly amount, and sales are the total price. \u003cposted\u003eprice.as_posted\u003c/posted\u003e keeps the advertiser's amount and period. These are asking prices, not transaction prices.\"},\"location\":{\"title\":\"Neighborhoods and location\",\"body\":\"Listings are mapped to Kite's neighborhood ids, with Arabic and English names, using the listing's coordinates and the neighborhood the source names. Coordinates are as precise as the source makes them; some sources round or offset them.\"},\"market\":{\"title\":\"Market statistics\",\"body\":\"Every aggregate uses one sample: live listings updated in the last 30 days, after quality filtering. Responses return the sample size, and medians are left empty when a sample is too small to mean anything. Trends read listing and price history kept since March 2026.\"},\"limits\":{\"title\":\"Limits\",\"body\":\"Coverage depends on what sources publish: it is deepest in Riyadh, Jeddah and the Eastern Province, and thinner in smaller cities, where outlier bounds are also looser. Sources can change or disappear. Photos are served from Kite's CDN; a listing whose photos haven't been copied yet appears a little later.\"}},\"claude\":{\"connect\":\"Connect to Claude\",\"title\":\"Use Kite in Claude\",\"sub\":\"Listed in Anthropic's Connectors Directory. One connection works in claude.ai, Claude Desktop, Claude mobile and Claude Code.\",\"other\":\"Using another AI app?\",\"try\":\"Try asking\",\"steps\":{\"connect\":{\"title\":\"Connect\",\"body\":\"Open Kite in Claude's directory and select Connect.\"},\"signIn\":{\"title\":\"Sign in\",\"body\":\"Enter the 6-digit code Kite emails you and pick a workspace.\"},\"ask\":{\"title\":\"Ask\",\"body\":\"Ask about listings, prices and neighborhoods in plain words.\"}},\"examples\":{\"rent\":\"2-bedroom apartments for rent in Al Yasmin under 60,000 SAR\",\"fair\":\"Is this villa priced fairly for Al Narjis?\",\"yield\":\"Which north Riyadh neighborhoods have the best rental yield?\"}},\"code\":{\"terminal\":\"Terminal\",\"language\":\"Language\",\"copyExample\":\"Copy {language} example\",\"copyRequest\":\"Copy example request\",\"copyKey\":\"Copy API key\",\"keyWarning\":\"Copy this key now. For your security, it won't be shown again.\",\"try\":\"Try it\"},\"labels\":{\"studio\":\"Studio\",\"beds\":\"{count} bd\",\"year\":\"/yr\",\"sar\":\"SAR {value}\",\"sarMillions\":\"SAR {value}M\",\"property\":{\"apartment\":\"apartment\",\"villa\":\"villa\",\"floor\":\"floor\",\"duplex\":\"duplex\",\"office\":\"office\",\"shop\":\"shop\",\"warehouse\":\"warehouse\",\"land\":\"land\",\"building\":\"building\",\"other\":\"property\"}},\"tiles\":{\"riyadh\":\"Riyadh\",\"rent\":\"Rent\",\"apartments\":\"3 bd apartments\",\"results\":\"{count} results\",\"medianRent\":\"median rent per year\",\"liveListings\":\"live listings\",\"live\":\"Live\",\"marketMedian\":\"Market median\",\"comparables\":\"{count} comparables\",\"selling\":\"Selling\",\"construction\":\"Under construction\",\"soon\":\"Coming soon\",\"completed\":\"Completed\",\"sold\":\"Sold out\",\"from\":\"From {price}\",\"units\":\"{count} units\",\"newToday\":\"{count} new today\",\"inRiyadh\":\"in Riyadh\",\"asking\":\"Asking price\",\"medianComps\":\"Median of {count} comparables\",\"inLine\":\"In line\",\"yield\":\"Gross yield · 3 bd apartments · Riyadh\",\"crm\":\"CRM · Listings\",\"synced\":\"Synced\",\"fromDarak\":\"From Kite, last 24 hours\",\"newRiyadh\":\"new Riyadh listings\",\"tracked\":\"3 bd rentals tracked\"}},\"pricing\":{\"period\":\"Billing period\",\"monthly\":\"Monthly\",\"annual\":\"Annual\",\"save\":\"Save {percent}%\",\"currency\":\"Currency\",\"popular\":\"Popular\",\"perMonth\":\"per month\",\"billedAnnual\":\"Billed annually\",\"from\":\"from {amount}\",\"inherits\":\"Everything in {plan}, plus:\",\"hardStop\":\"Hard stop at the limit\",\"overage\":\"Then {amount} per 1,000 units\",\"enterprisePeriod\":\"· {amount} / month, billed annually\",\"plans\":\"Plans\",\"sub\":\"Start free. Upgrade when you need market statistics, valuation data or volume.\",\"billingSoon\":\"Paid plans: billing launches soon, join the waitlist\",\"choose\":\"Choose {plan}\",\"waitlist\":\"Join waitlist\",\"talk\":\"Talk to us\",\"getKey\":\"Get your free API key\",\"early\":\"Request early access\",\"dashboard\":\"Open dashboard\",\"create\":\"Create your API account\",\"offers\":{\"free\":{\"tagline\":\"Build and test an integration.\",\"allowance\":\"250 units / month\"},\"starter\":{\"tagline\":\"A live product or a nightly city sync.\",\"allowance\":\"50,000 units / month\"},\"growth\":{\"tagline\":\"Valuation, investment and pricing features.\",\"allowance\":\"200,000 units / month\"},\"pro\":{\"tagline\":\"Off-plan projects and national syncs.\",\"allowance\":\"750,000 units / month\"},\"enterprise\":{\"tagline\":\"Custom volume, data and terms.\",\"allowance\":\"Committed volume\"}},\"features\":{\"listings\":\"Live listings: search, detail, price history\",\"reference\":\"Reference data\",\"rate30\":\"30 units / minute\",\"results25\":\"25 results per page\",\"market\":\"Market statistics\",\"rate60\":\"60 units / minute\",\"results50\":\"50 results per page\",\"analytics\":\"Valuation \u0026 investment\",\"rate150\":\"150 units / minute\",\"results100\":\"100 results per page\",\"projects\":\"Off-plan projects\",\"rate300\":\"300 units / minute\",\"paging\":\"Paging up to 20,000 results\",\"custom\":\"Custom rate limits and quotas\",\"sso\":\"SSO and IP allowlists\",\"invoicing\":\"Invoicing in SAR\"},\"pilot\":{\"title\":\"Valuation checks\",\"paid\":\"· paid pilot\",\"sub\":\"For valuers, lenders and rent financiers: comparables, market position and a price range for a property you're assessing, priced per check in SAR.\",\"how\":\"How it works\",\"request\":\"Request a pilot\"},\"footnote\":\"Prices exclude VAT. Saudi businesses account for VAT under the reverse charge; add your VAT number at checkout. {currency} You set a monthly spend cap on extra usage: we alert you at 80% and 100% and never bill above it. Startups in Saudi programs such as REGA's PropTech Hub, and academic researchers: \u003cdiscount\u003eask about our discounts\u003c/discount\u003e.\",\"sarBilled\":\"Billed in Saudi riyals.\",\"usdBilled\":\"Billed in US dollars.\"},\"metadata\":{\"landingTitle\":\"Kite API — real estate data for Saudi Arabia\",\"landingDescription\":\"Live listings, market statistics, valuations and off-plan projects from 20+ Saudi sources, deduplicated and served through one documented API. Free to start.\",\"pricingTitle\":\"Kite API pricing\",\"pricingDescription\":\"Plans for the Kite API: start free, then pay for market statistics, valuation data and volume. Monthly or annual billing in SAR or USD, plus Enterprise.\",\"dataTitle\":\"Data coverage and methodology\",\"dataDescription\":\"Where Kite's Saudi real estate data comes from: sources, cities, freshness, how duplicates are merged, how outliers are filtered and what prices mean.\",\"valuationTitle\":\"Valuation checks: market evidence for Saudi valuations\",\"valuationDescription\":\"Comparables, market position and a price band for the property you're assessing, from every live Saudi listing, beside REGA registered rents and Ministry of Justice deals. Pilot open to valuers, lenders and rent financiers.\",\"docsTitle\":\"API reference\",\"docsDescription\":\"The Kite API reference: endpoints, parameters, responses and examples for Saudi property listings, market analytics, valuation data and projects.\",\"guidesTitle\":\"Kite API guides\",\"guidesDescription\":\"Written guides to building with the Kite API: authentication, searching, pagination, error handling and reliable data integrations.\",\"changelogTitle\":\"API changelog\",\"changelogDescription\":\"Every change to the Kite API, newest first: new endpoints, fields, plans and deprecations, with the spec fingerprint for each release.\",\"statusTitle\":\"Kite API status\",\"statusDescription\":\"Live uptime and response times for the Kite API, checked every 5 minutes, plus any open incidents.\",\"securityTitle\":\"Security\",\"securityDescription\":\"How Kite protects your API keys, account and data: key handling, access controls, retention and the subprocessors involved.\",\"signinTitle\":\"Sign in\",\"onboardingTitle\":\"Create your API account\",\"inviteTitle\":\"Invitation\",\"consentTitle\":\"Authorize access\",\"continueTitle\":\"Continue\",\"adminTitle\":\"Platform funnel\",\"dashboardTitle\":\"API dashboard\",\"overviewTitle\":\"Overview\",\"usageTitle\":\"Usage\",\"logsTitle\":\"Logs\",\"playgroundTitle\":\"Playground\",\"keysTitle\":\"API keys\",\"projectsTitle\":\"Projects\",\"membersTitle\":\"Members\",\"planTitle\":\"Plan \u0026 limits\",\"billingTitle\":\"Billing\",\"auditTitle\":\"Audit log\",\"settingsTitle\":\"Settings\"},\"routing\":{\"title\":\"Guide not found — Kite API\",\"heading\":\"That guide doesn’t exist.\",\"description\":\"The link may be incorrect or the guide may have moved. Browse the available guides or open the API reference.\",\"eyebrow\":\"404 · DOCUMENTATION\",\"navigation\":\"Documentation\",\"guides\":\"Browse guides\",\"reference\":\"API reference\"},\"reference\":{\"downloadSpec\":\"Download the original OpenAPI contract (English)\",\"skipToContent\":\"Skip to API reference\",\"hydrateFailed\":\"Interactive reference controls could not load. The documentation below is still readable; reload to try again or download the original OpenAPI contract.\"}}},\"now\":\"$undefined\",\"timeZone\":\"Asia/Riyadh\",\"children\":[\"$L51\",\"$L52\"]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"53:\"PlatformLocalePreference\"\n54:I[814062,[\"$6\",\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$39\"],\"$53\"]\n51:[\"$\",\"$L54\",null,{}]\n52:[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":\"$undefined\",\"forbidden\":\"$undefined\",\"unauthorized\":\"$undefined\"}